Comment: A build of upstream GTK with the downstream patches in patches/ of the
 amber-gtk4 source package applied; each patch's header says what it changes.
 Corresponding source for this build: the release tarball
 https://download.gnome.org/sources/gtk/4.16/gtk-4.16.13.tar.xz plus those patches.
 The library is shipped as a separate, dynamically linked .so under the private path
 /usr/lib/amber-gtk4/, so the LGPL's shared-library terms apply.

